                      00001 ;**************************************************************************
                      00002 ; FILE:      frqmeter.asm                                                 *
                      00003 ; CONTENTS:  Digital frequency meter                                      *
                      00004 ; COPYRIGHT: MadLab Ltd. 1996-2005                                        *
